WEBVTT

00:00.587 --> 00:09.444
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:00.593 --> 00:09.444
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.620 --> 00:46.806
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.620 --> 00:46.807
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.040 --> 00:56.173
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.040 --> 00:56.174
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.789 --> 01:14.837
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.796 --> 01:14.837
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.765 --> 01:30.685
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.604 --> 01:33.939
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.815 --> 01:35.858
Black Jack.

01:47.540 --> 01:48.623
Hello!

01:49.041 --> 01:49.833
This is Acchon!

01:50.187 --> 01:51.087
This is Burike!

01:51.460 --> 01:54.254
Together, we're Acchonburike!!

01:55.680 --> 01:56.680
I'm bored.

01:59.389 --> 02:01.098
Dinner is ready.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.936
Floor's polished very well.

02:06.438 --> 02:08.230
Laundry's done.

02:09.149 --> 02:10.691
There's no mail.

02:13.361 --> 02:14.487
Doc!

02:15.113 --> 02:16.113
What?!

02:16.114 --> 02:19.742
I told you not to talk to me while I'm working.

02:20.744 --> 02:22.912
I'm bored!

02:23.622 --> 02:24.413
Bored?

02:25.165 --> 02:25.790
Why?

02:26.208 --> 02:28.709
I'm bored because there's nothing to do!

02:30.045 --> 02:30.753
Bored!!

02:30.754 --> 02:31.253
Bored!!!

02:31.254 --> 02:31.879
Bored!!!!

02:31.880 --> 02:32.379
Bored!!!!!

02:32.380 --> 02:32.797
Bored!!!!!!

02:32.839 --> 02:34.256
OK, OK!

02:34.758 --> 02:36.592
I'll see you when I'm done.

02:39.387 --> 02:41.639
Doc, you meanie!

02:55.904 --> 02:59.073
Largo, what's wrong?

03:02.577 --> 03:03.411
H-hey.

03:03.865 --> 03:04.787
Sharaku!

03:05.038 --> 03:07.289
Why are you here?

03:07.825 --> 03:09.083
I ran away.

03:09.209 --> 03:10.292
Will you protect me?

03:10.836 --> 03:12.044
You ran away?

03:13.171 --> 03:14.630
Come out, Sharaku!

03:15.090 --> 03:16.841
I know you're here!

03:17.518 --> 03:18.342
She's here!

03:19.553 --> 03:21.137
There's no use hiding!

03:22.264 --> 03:23.764
Come out, Sharaku!

03:23.870 --> 03:25.326
No way!

03:25.326 --> 03:26.142
Wait!

03:26.226 --> 03:28.352
I said there was no use running away!

03:29.187 --> 03:29.937
Hey!

03:30.814 --> 03:33.023
What's the deal here?

03:33.650 --> 03:36.235
Sharaku says he doesn't want to go to school.

03:36.695 --> 03:37.778
School?

03:38.613 --> 03:41.657
He said he doesn't want to go to school anymore.

03:42.242 --> 03:43.951
So I scolded him and said that he has to.

03:44.035 --> 03:45.244
Then he ran away.

03:46.496 --> 03:49.039
Sharaku, why don't you want to go?

03:49.541 --> 03:51.500
No, I don't want to tell you.

03:52.252 --> 03:54.170
You'll get upset if I do.

03:54.296 --> 03:55.880
And you're scary when you do.

03:57.090 --> 04:00.092
I won't get upset, so tell me honestly.

04:00.886 --> 04:01.886
Really?

04:04.306 --> 04:06.140
I didn't do my homework.

04:06.391 --> 04:07.183
Homework?

04:07.976 --> 04:10.186
You can do it now.

04:10.812 --> 04:12.772
It's difficult, and I can't.

04:13.273 --> 04:16.650
I'll help you, so let's start.

04:16.735 --> 04:19.111
I'll help you, too.

04:19.312 --> 04:20.279
Let's do it.

04:20.447 --> 04:22.573
No! I'm too lazy!

04:23.240 --> 04:25.534
Jeez! Don't say that!

04:25.786 --> 04:27.286
See, you got upset!

04:27.454 --> 04:28.329
Of course!

04:29.164 --> 04:31.040
Which homework? Literature?

04:31.083 --> 04:31.957
Math?

04:32.125 --> 04:32.833
Social Studies?

04:33.927 --> 04:34.794
Math.

04:35.003 --> 04:36.253
Let me see.

04:36.713 --> 04:38.297
What don't you understand?

04:40.300 --> 04:42.760
I did the homework for you.

04:45.430 --> 04:47.973
It's all messed up!

04:50.977 --> 04:51.727
Shut up!

04:51.895 --> 04:53.062
You're disturbing my work!

04:54.022 --> 04:55.022
Excuse us!

04:55.357 --> 04:57.024
Literature, Social Studies...

04:57.025 --> 04:58.192
Excuse us!

04:59.569 --> 05:01.237
Why were they here?

05:01.613 --> 05:02.687
School.

05:03.824 --> 05:04.448
School?

05:07.060 --> 05:10.270
Originally by Tezuka Osamu - One Teacher and a Pupil

05:07.060 --> 05:10.270
One Teacher and a Pupil

05:21.410 --> 05:23.492
Hisao, aren't you going to school?

05:24.327 --> 05:26.829
My head hurts, so I can't go.

05:27.789 --> 05:28.664
Again?

05:29.541 --> 05:31.583
Did something happen at school?

05:32.836 --> 05:33.877
Nothing.

05:34.462 --> 05:38.632
If your head hurts that much, I'll
ask the doctor to give you a shot.

05:39.592 --> 05:42.469
Yup, a shot that hurts really bad.

05:44.305 --> 05:44.847
No!

05:45.390 --> 05:46.765
I don't want any shots!

05:47.153 --> 05:48.434
No!

05:49.602 --> 05:52.020
See, there's nothing wrong with you.

05:52.731 --> 05:54.273
Now, wash your face.

06:01.322 --> 06:02.656
I'm off.

06:06.035 --> 06:08.120
You'll be late if you walk that slow.

06:32.145 --> 06:34.438
You're not bright.

06:38.485 --> 06:40.360
You can't even solve such an easy math problem?

06:40.779 --> 06:43.322
How many times do I have to teach you the same thing?!

06:46.284 --> 06:48.660
Go back to kindergarten one more time.

06:49.746 --> 06:52.331
And learn not to wet your bed anymore.

06:55.668 --> 06:58.253
Hey! What's one plus one?

06:58.963 --> 07:01.173
Even a kindergartner should know that!

07:01.549 --> 07:02.549
Answer me!

07:06.137 --> 07:06.762
It's two.

07:08.181 --> 07:10.432
At least you know that much.

07:14.985 --> 07:16.313
What's so funny?!

07:17.399 --> 07:21.235
Now what is twice 15 subtracted from twice 25?

07:24.427 --> 07:26.113
Huh? What is it?

07:28.201 --> 07:31.286
Don't be laughing if you don't even know that!

07:31.830 --> 07:34.331
Go work on it until you figure it out!

07:46.845 --> 07:48.679
I won't let you go home until you're done.

07:53.915 --> 07:57.187
I have the urge to hit the students with bad manners.

07:57.856 --> 08:00.858
Yeah, it's really stressing me out.

08:01.151 --> 08:02.901
We're human too.

08:06.573 --> 08:08.907
I will never be violent.

08:10.326 --> 08:12.828
But I hit them with words.

08:13.105 --> 08:14.105
With words?

08:14.205 --> 08:14.997
Yup.

08:15.290 --> 08:17.958
I slam them with harsh words.

08:18.543 --> 08:22.087
They get hurt as much as being hit hard.

08:22.672 --> 08:25.257
But won't the students hate you?

08:25.842 --> 08:26.759
Yeah, yeah.

08:27.177 --> 08:30.971
A few kids look at me like I'm slime.

08:31.514 --> 08:39.855
But I'm hoping that students will feel ashamed,
get inspired, and start studying like mad.

08:40.565 --> 08:45.569
But not all kids these days have that kind of spirit.

08:46.362 --> 08:50.407
If they don't have the spirit then I will
continue to hit them with words.

08:51.326 --> 08:54.213
I know they will want to study eventually.

08:54.579 --> 08:57.081
That might be true if you were a student,

08:57.415 --> 09:00.000
but there are many kinds of kids out there.

09:00.126 --> 09:01.043
He's right.

09:01.377 --> 09:04.213
Kids these days are fragile too.

09:04.881 --> 09:07.966
I will straighten those students out.

09:12.430 --> 09:13.514
I'm heading home now.

09:13.807 --> 09:14.681
That's for my beer.

09:20.897 --> 09:25.275
Muramasa-kun is very earnest about his
work, but he's also very stubborn.

09:25.777 --> 09:28.946
I hope he won't cause any trouble.

09:34.077 --> 09:36.161
You want to skip school again?

09:36.704 --> 09:38.288
What's wrong?

09:39.916 --> 09:41.750
There must be something.

09:42.085 --> 09:43.627
Would you tell me secretly?

09:43.878 --> 09:44.545
What is it?

09:47.298 --> 09:49.758
I hate my homeroom teacher, Mr. Muramasa.

09:51.094 --> 09:52.678
He picks on me.

09:53.138 --> 09:54.680
You're just imagining it.

09:55.348 --> 09:58.892
Your last teacher was too kind, and
you couldn't even trust him.

10:01.146 --> 10:03.939
I will have a talk with him later.

10:04.441 --> 10:06.150
Go to school.

10:07.402 --> 10:08.527
No!

10:08.987 --> 10:09.987
Hisao!

10:10.196 --> 10:12.281
I'd rather die than go to school!

10:12.449 --> 10:14.825
Don't be so spoiled!

10:14.826 --> 10:15.492
No!

10:15.702 --> 10:16.452
No!

10:16.786 --> 10:17.494
No!

10:17.912 --> 10:19.496
NO!!

10:29.716 --> 10:32.417
Why is my son so bad?

10:45.523 --> 10:48.025
I don't want to go to school.

10:56.826 --> 10:59.328
How could I skip school?

11:01.081 --> 11:02.581
I want to get sick.

11:04.292 --> 11:08.295
If I get seriously ill, then I can stay home for a long time.

11:10.256 --> 11:11.548
Or I can get hurt too.

11:40.703 --> 11:43.789
These are 2nd grade level problems.

11:44.290 --> 11:48.877
Go to the 2nd grade class right now,
and have them teach you!

11:50.880 --> 11:52.005
Don't be shy.

11:52.132 --> 11:53.799
Go now!

11:53.967 --> 11:54.717
Now!

11:54.718 --> 11:55.759
Mr. Muramasa.

12:00.598 --> 12:01.724
This just came in...

12:04.602 --> 12:06.145
That was the vice principal.

12:06.688 --> 12:07.938
I wonder what it is.

12:09.941 --> 12:14.778
I guess Hisao is not tardy, but got hit
by a bike on his way to school.

12:16.104 --> 12:17.204
N-no way!

12:17.365 --> 12:18.615
What an idiot.

12:19.242 --> 12:21.910
Sensei, is Hisao-kun okay?

12:22.290 --> 12:23.287
Did he die?

12:23.872 --> 12:25.205
It's not serious.

12:25.665 --> 12:26.915
Did he get hurt?

12:27.292 --> 12:28.751
Can we go see him?

12:29.711 --> 12:31.336
Don't worry about him.

12:31.588 --> 12:33.046
We're still in class.

12:33.324 --> 12:34.590
I guess it's not serious.

12:34.897 --> 12:35.645
But...

12:35.699 --> 12:36.799
Which hospital?

12:41.048 --> 12:42.639
He crossed during a red light.

12:52.410 --> 12:53.690
Sensei, how is he?

12:53.691 --> 12:55.359
Is he okay?

12:55.360 --> 12:56.151
Sensei!

12:58.029 --> 13:00.822
Hello, is this Chuo-machi General Hospital?

13:01.532 --> 13:05.233
I'm calling regarding the condition of a kid named
Hisao who was taken in from a traffic accident.

13:06.037 --> 13:07.454
He's in critical condition.

13:07.705 --> 13:12.084
He has a concussion, and the bones
in his legs are shattered.

13:12.752 --> 13:16.046
We will have to amputate both of his legs.

13:17.173 --> 13:19.591
Cut both legs off?!

13:20.051 --> 13:20.759
Yes.

13:23.263 --> 13:24.596
I see...

13:37.402 --> 13:38.151
Tezuka-kun!

13:40.280 --> 13:41.321
Muramasa-kun!

13:41.322 --> 13:42.948
Help me, Tezuka-kun!

13:43.546 --> 13:45.207
What happened?

13:45.386 --> 13:46.826
You look troubled.

13:47.093 --> 13:48.626
That's very unlike you.

13:49.080 --> 13:51.707
Can you save my student?

13:58.464 --> 13:59.840
Can you do something?

14:00.675 --> 14:05.637
There is, I suppose, one doctor
who could save your student...

14:06.389 --> 14:07.598
Who is that?!

14:08.099 --> 14:09.975
He's the most skilled doctor in the world,

14:09.976 --> 14:12.603
but he's whimsical and twisted,

14:12.604 --> 14:17.149
so I can't guarantee that he'll operate
on him, and if you don't mind that...

14:17.275 --> 14:18.479
That's fine!

14:18.559 --> 14:19.943
Tell me!

14:26.743 --> 14:27.993
Dr. Black Jack.

14:28.703 --> 14:29.494
Who are you?

14:30.163 --> 14:33.123
This is Muramasa from Akebono Elementary School.

14:33.625 --> 14:36.543
My student will lose both of his legs from a traffic accident.

14:36.961 --> 14:38.003
He's in critical condition.

14:38.296 --> 14:42.132
I heard you're the only doctor who
can save him without amputating.

14:42.550 --> 14:46.011
Doctor, please! Save him!

14:47.055 --> 14:48.472
Cut them off.

14:48.973 --> 14:51.433
If that's what needs to be done to save
his life, then you can't help it.

14:54.062 --> 14:56.688
Doctor, he's only a child.

14:56.981 --> 15:01.401
If you operate on him, he may not have to lose his legs.

15:03.529 --> 15:04.988
What do you want me to do?

15:05.490 --> 15:08.242
Please head to the hospital right now, and operate on him!

15:10.161 --> 15:11.745
I'm not a philanthropist.

15:12.455 --> 15:13.538
I know!

15:13.915 --> 15:15.707
I will pay your fee!

15:16.167 --> 15:17.960
How much do I need?

15:18.753 --> 15:21.380
I would like to ask 50,000,000...

15:22.298 --> 15:23.674
But let's say 30,000,000.

15:24.092 --> 15:25.467
30,000,000!

15:26.636 --> 15:29.137
I'll do it if you can pay.

15:29.764 --> 15:31.431
Otherwise, I refuse.

15:31.933 --> 15:32.641
Bye.

15:41.609 --> 15:42.359
Come in.

15:44.153 --> 15:45.362
How is he?

15:46.573 --> 15:52.327
Well, Sensei, it's hard to discuss this with you.

15:53.454 --> 15:56.623
He said he hated school.

15:59.419 --> 16:02.421
This morning too, he refused to go to school.

16:05.633 --> 16:09.428
But I forced him out.

16:12.021 --> 16:19.062
According to the bike rider, he just
trotted in front of the bike.

16:27.405 --> 16:34.244
Sensei, he said he was very scared of you.

16:37.707 --> 16:41.209
He despised seeing you!

16:57.352 --> 17:00.729
Hey, Doc, where are we going all of a sudden?

17:01.481 --> 17:02.272
Just somewhere.

17:03.417 --> 17:06.317
Sign: Chuo-machi General Hospital

17:20.083 --> 17:22.459
Doc! Wait up!

17:32.554 --> 17:35.389
My, my! Dr. Black Jack!

17:35.598 --> 17:36.932
I've heard much about you.

17:37.267 --> 17:40.602
There's a kid suffering from a traffic accident here, right?

17:42.245 --> 17:42.933
Yes.

17:47.151 --> 17:50.028
He despised seeing you.

17:50.613 --> 17:53.949
He said he was very scared of you.

17:54.909 --> 17:58.161
We will have to amputate both of his legs.

18:18.641 --> 18:22.519
So, Doctor, will you have to amputate them?

18:24.606 --> 18:25.230
No.

18:32.406 --> 18:33.196
Emergency!

18:33.323 --> 18:34.865
There was a traffic accident near the hospital!

18:35.325 --> 18:37.117
The victim is the elementary school teacher.

18:37.577 --> 18:38.535
What?!

18:40.163 --> 18:41.079
This is horrible.

18:41.205 --> 18:41.997
Hurry with the treatment!

18:42.332 --> 18:43.749
He just walked out.

18:44.042 --> 18:47.794
He slammed on the brake, but I couldn't stop.

18:52.008 --> 18:53.008
Black Jack-kun!

18:53.259 --> 18:55.385
He's my friend.

18:57.889 --> 19:02.643
He was stumbling around, so I was
just going to yell "Look out".

19:03.509 --> 19:04.978
He's nearly dead.

19:05.688 --> 19:06.855
We can't save him.

19:10.235 --> 19:12.402
Hey, is he saying something?

19:13.404 --> 19:16.114
Dr. Black Jack...

19:18.493 --> 19:22.829
Sorry, I'm the one who told him about you.

19:22.997 --> 19:27.334
Tell Dr. Black Jack.

19:27.961 --> 19:38.303
When I die, I have life insurance...

19:38.572 --> 19:40.514
What are you talking about, Muramasa-kun!

19:40.807 --> 19:42.266
Think straight!

19:42.642 --> 19:47.980
Give him the money as the surgery fee.

19:50.441 --> 19:53.193
Save his legs...

19:53.693 --> 19:55.654
His legs...

19:56.531 --> 19:57.573
Muramasa-kun!

20:00.868 --> 20:04.162
Sorry, but there will be no insurance money.

20:05.847 --> 20:06.769
Because...

20:09.586 --> 20:11.461
I will save him!

20:12.755 --> 20:14.923
I will operate on the kid and the teacher right now!

20:17.020 --> 20:19.934
Operation in progress

20:39.991 --> 20:43.327
They're both doing fine, all thanks to you.

20:43.661 --> 20:47.998
That was a miraculous operation, to save their lives.

20:48.458 --> 20:54.046
You know, Muramasa-kun was my
elementary school classmate.

20:55.924 --> 21:01.261
Unlike now, he used to be timid, and got picked on a lot.

21:02.013 --> 21:06.099
He tried to skip school a lot, but we went to his house,

21:06.809 --> 21:09.186
and forced him to go to school.

21:10.146 --> 21:13.982
Anyway, why did you put them in the same room?

21:14.817 --> 21:17.986
It looked like they were doing pretty well together.

21:19.364 --> 21:22.324
What is twice 10 subtracted from twice 15?

21:22.784 --> 21:25.911
Um... 10.

21:26.454 --> 21:27.412
Correct.

21:27.872 --> 21:31.875
Next. What is twice 15 subtracted from twice 25?

21:32.502 --> 21:33.752
Um...

21:36.289 --> 21:38.465
25 and... um...

21:38.550 --> 21:40.592
I don't have enough fingers.

21:40.927 --> 21:42.553
Pinoco, let's get going.

21:43.596 --> 21:44.763
Wait up!

21:45.807 --> 21:47.140
Hey, Doc,

21:47.225 --> 21:47.933
What?

21:48.268 --> 21:50.310
I want to go to school!

21:50.770 --> 21:51.687
School?

21:52.021 --> 21:53.063
What, all of a sudden?

21:53.314 --> 21:57.234
Because I'm bored staying home all the time.

21:58.319 --> 21:59.361
School, huh?

22:01.114 --> 22:02.489
When the time comes.

22:02.699 --> 22:03.490
Yeah!

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
being heated up by you,

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
so much that I change color

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
I couldn't be happier

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.985 --> 23:33.919
How does it taste?

23:28.985 --> 23:33.918
oaji wa ikaga?

23:45.771 --> 23:46.685
There they are!

23:48.941 --> 23:51.151
I'm right there, right now!

23:51.690 --> 23:53.858
I'll be responsible for this.

23:56.403 --> 23:58.237
W-What?!

23:59.114 --> 24:00.073
